# The Quota slice: places, people and the record the scenes write. Story lead, 2026-10-21. Private.
# For the gameplay engineer: the record events of design/quota/04-SYSTEMS.md section 3 are written as
# facts and vars here, so the community model can read them when it lands:
#   q_class     inspector | militia            (class gating; chosen at q.start until the shell does it)
#   q_figure    true | inflated | blamed       (report.figure; blamed is also blame.people, victim Tomas)
#   q_cart      taken | through | arrested     (refuse.pass at the road post; arrested is Tomas held)
#   q_door      talked | held | broken | aside (the granary door)
#   q.true_in_hand  the player's body has met the bare truth (the wedge in his coat, the light sacks lifted,
#                   the rock in Tesk's fold, the half sack left slumped, the arm let rise; weighted devices 2026-10-23)
#   q.tomas_held    Tomas Haldane is in the cells by nightfall
# The coda reads them; the read-back quotes them.

