@char q.daughter
name: Anni's daughter
speaker: DAUGHTER
faction: hesh
about: Anni's girl, twelve, years after the winter. She found the tin under the stairs and opened it.

@char q.sister
name: Sister Agnes, the Furrow Church's home
speaker: SISTER
faction: district
about: Keeps the gate of the children's home on Tilney Road. Feeds them once a day and takes the thread off at the door.

@char q.lind
name: Dr Clara Lind
speaker: LIND
faction: district
about: The district's doctor for the cells and the fever. Says what killed them in one word, out loud, and does not argue.

@char q.dorrah
name: Dorrah Tesk
speaker: DORRAH
faction: hesh
about: Old Tesk's wife, on the hill above Krall's End. Has six town children in her hut that are not hers.

@char q.fenn
name: Corporal Fenn
speaker: FENN
faction: directorate
about: One of Holt's corporals at the granary. Nineteen, from Tilney. Does what he is told and then says sorry to the wrong person.

@char q.iris
name: Iris Krall
speaker: IRIS
faction: chairmen
about: Jonah Krall's wife. Knows everything said at the pump by noon.

@fact q.anni_sent
about: Anni Haldane went in at the gate on Tilney Road.
by: Bet Haldane
@fact q.aaron_taken
about: Aaron Haldane was taken from Haldane Yard.
by: Constable Gedge
@fact q.ilo_mark
about: Ilo Haldane walked the squad up the path to Tesk's fold, so his boy would come home.
by: Ilo Haldane
@fact q.dorrah_taken
about: The squad took Dorrah Tesk off the hill.
by: Captain Holt
@fact q.cart_stripped
@fact q.ned_claimed
@fact q.ned_parentage
@fact q.will_bread
@fact q.looked_in
@fact q.corner_known
@fact q.tesk_sent

@char q.rose
name: Rose Brack
speaker: ROSE
faction: millstreet
about: Six. Eats out of her mother's bowl on her knee.

@var water_carried
default: 0

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the echoes: what happened, met in the places
# Weighted-devices pass, era 2, 2026-10-23 (engine: world/echo.mjs; gates: tools/echocheck.mjs, tools/devicecheck.mjs).
# Every fate of the era and every world fact it leaves is met in a place the story brings the player back to: the
# Haldane table a week later, the Brack and Furrowe kitchens, the square under the burial ground, a later run's dawn.
@echo q.e.stool
place: q_haldane
when: has(q.tomas_held) & cday() >= 45
from: 2
to: 2
tells: fate f.tomas_held
tells: worldfact world.dead.tomas
show: absent q.tomas
line: A stool against the wall that nobody sits on and nobody moves. Aaron goes round it to get to the stove, the long way, every time.
sense: chair.empty

@echo q.e.anni
place: q_haldane
when: has(q.anni_sent) | has(q.anni_furrowe)
from: 2
to: 2
tells: fate f.anni_home
tells: worldfact world.anni_home
show: absent q.anni
line: Anni's stool is pushed in under the table, tight, the way nobody pushes a stool in who's coming back to it tonight. Nobody in the kitchen is counting anything out loud.
sense: room.cold

@echo q.e.coat
place: q_haldane, q_yard
when: has(q.aaron_taken)
from: 2
to: 2
tells: fate f.aaron_taken
show: absent q.aaron
line: The smallest hook by the door is empty. Somebody has bent the nail down flat, so nothing else gets hung on it.
sense: breath.held

@echo q.e.cap
place: q_brack_kitchen
when: q_class == militia & has(q.tomas_held) & cday() >= 45
from: 2
to: 2
tells: fate f.tomas_held
tells: lore q.lore.cell_log
show: person q.davey still
line: Behind the door, on the nail over Will's coat, a boy's brown cap. Davey won't sit with his back to it.
sense: q.cap.hold

@echo q.e.stitches
place: q_brack_kitchen
when: has(q.will_down)
from: 2
to: 2
tells: worldfact world.will_down
show: person q.davey still
line: The twist of black thread Edie stitched with is still on the table by the bread knife. Nobody has put it away.

@echo q.e.corner
place: q_tower
when: has(q.tomas_held) & cday() >= 47 | prior(world.dead.tomas)
from: 2
to: 2
tells: worldfact world.dead.tomas
line: Past the church, beyond the gap in the railings, the corner where the ground's been turned over and trodden flat. The frost lies differently on it.
sense: room.cold

# a quota as a child's hunger at the player's own table
@echo q.e.davey
place: q_brack_kitchen
when: q_class == militia & stock(portion, brack) < 1
from: 2
to: 2
tells: flag said.will_report_true
show: person q.davey slump
line: Davey eats with his arm round his bowl, bent right over it, the way the children in the relief queue do. When it's empty he goes on scraping.
sense: q.spoon.scrape

@echo q.e.pell
place: q_furrowe_kitchen
when: q_class == inspector & stock(portion, furrowe) < 1
from: 2
to: 2
tells: flag said.ned_report_true
show: person q.pell slump
line: Pell holds his bowl up under his chin and scrapes it with the side of his spoon, and when it's empty he goes on scraping, and nobody tells him to stop.
sense: q.spoon.scrape
